{"v":1,"hlc":"1794084809401.0000.49d81004837e","type":"card.set","by":"stephane.wetterwald@gmail.com","fields":{"title":"pre-push sous Windows : ne pas lancer la suite bash de collie-board-ctl","spec":"Sur le Dell, une fois les tests bun verts (1907 pass, 0 fail), le pre-push lance collie-board-ctl.test.sh, qui appelle python : « Python was not found » (alias Microsoft Store) → push refusé. Sous Windows le plugin passe par scripts/ctl.ts, pas par collie-board-ctl.sh : sauter cette suite quand l OS est Windows (uname MINGW/MSYS/CYGWIN ou OS=Windows_NT), avec un message, et laisser la CI Linux la jouer.","raw_input":null,"acceptance":["Sur le Dell, git push d une branche saine passe sans SKIP_TESTS","Sous Linux, le pre-push joue toujours collie-board-ctl.test.sh"],"status":"backlog","base_ref":"main","branch":null,"agent_kind":null,"parent_id":null,"duplicate_of":null,"depends_on":null,"origin":"agent","origin_card_id":null,"category":null,"tag":null,"position":-714,"run_id":null,"phase_id":null,"template_id":null,"pipeline_id":null,"created_at":1794084807684,"created_by":"stephane.wetterwald@gmail.com","assignee":null,"manual_checks":null,"capability":null,"usage_group":null,"check_verdicts":null}}
